    </h2>

    <div class="prose-lg text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed space-y-6 max-w-none opacity-95">
      <p>
        Blockprint is a one-day, one-block summer festival in the heart of Venice — a hand-pressed,
        hand-cut take on what an LA street party can be. We close down a stretch of Abbot Kinney,
        run a single stage, and bring together the artists, brands, and neighbors that make this
        corner of the city what it is.
      </p>
      <p>
        The name comes from the craft: a single sheet, pressed twice, never quite the same as the
        last one. That's the festival we want to throw — singular, unpolished in the right places,
        and built for the people standing in the room.
      </p>
      <p class="text-bp-pink font-semibold">
        August 22, 2026. Abbot Kinney Blvd. 21 and over.
      </p>
